- Allocate dispatch slot: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate (origin_availability_alpha, dispatch_slot_alpha, route_task_profile_alpha) (requires dispatch_ready origin, task profile linked, slot available)
- Execute origin dispatch: execute_origin_dispatch (origin_availability_alpha, vehicle_unit_alpha, dispatch_slot_alpha) (requires dispatch_allocated origin, candidate_vehicle_linked origin vehicle_unit_alpha, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked origin dispatch_slot_alpha, not dispatched origin). After this, dispatched origin true, vehicle_unit_alpha available, dispatch_slot_available true.

Now for destination_availability_alpha:
