- unload_destination_payload (destination_availability_alpha, destination_node_alpha, route_task_profile_alpha, cargo_payload_alpha)
- (Now destination_node_occupied true, destination_node_ready true, destination_availability_locked true, destination_availability_confirmed true, cargo_available true)
- Mark destination dispatch ready: mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready (destination_availability_alpha, transport_leg_alpha) after transport leg assembled and loading authorized.
- Allocate dispatch slot: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate (destination_availability_alpha, dispatch_slot_alpha, route_task_profile_alpha)
- Execute destination dispatch: execute_destination_dispatch (destination_availability_alpha, vehicle_unit_beta, dispatch_slot_alpha)

Now for shift_candidate_alpha:
