- Allocate dispatch slot: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate (shift_candidate_alpha, dispatch_slot_alpha, route_task_profile_alpha) (requires dispatch_ready shift_candidate_alpha (from finalize), task_profile_linked, slot available)
- Execute schedule dispatch: execute_schedule_dispatch (shift_candidate_alpha, vehicle_unit_gamma, dispatch_slot_alpha) (requires dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha, not dispatched shift_candidate_alpha)

